  {"text":"SUIT 02 · CH. 2","translation":"宇宙服 02 · チャンネル 2","where":"worlds/knock-on-the-porthole/scenes/observation-corridor/elements/intercom.js"},
  {"text":"COMMS","translation":"通信","where":"worlds/knock-on-the-porthole/scenes/observation-corridor/elements/intercom.js"},
  {"text":"JAMMED","translation":"固着","where":"worlds/knock-on-the-porthole/scenes/observation-corridor/elements/lida.js"},
  {"text":"AJAR","translation":"半開き","where":"worlds/knock-on-the-porthole/scenes/observation-corridor/elements/lida.js"},
  {"text":"LIDA · CORRIDOR 2-4","translation":"リダ · 通路 2-4","where":"worlds/knock-on-the-porthole/scenes/observation-corridor/elements/lida.js"},
  {"text":"AIRLOCK 2: {state}","translation":"エアロック 2：{state}","where":"worlds/knock-on-the-porthole/scenes/observation-corridor/elements/lida.js"},
  {"text":"CREW ON BOARD: 3/3","translation":"乗員在船：3/3","where":"worlds/knock-on-the-porthole/scenes/observation-corridor/elements/lida.js"},
  {"text":"CH. 2: VOICE","translation":"チャンネル 2：音声","where":"worlds/knock-on-the-porthole/scenes/observation-corridor/elements/lida.js"},
  {"text":"CH. 2: NOISE","translation":"チャンネル 2：雑音","where":"worlds/knock-on-the-porthole/scenes/observation-corridor/elements/lida.js"},
  {"text":"AIRLOCK 2  →","translation":"エアロック 2  →","where":"worlds/knock-on-the-porthole/scenes/observation-corridor/elements/wall_left.js"},
  {"text":"DECK 2 · SECT. 4","translation":"第2デッキ · 第4区画","where":"worlds/knock-on-the-porthole/scenes/observation-corridor/elements/wall_left.js"},
  {"text":"CHECK PRESSURE BEFORE EXIT","translation":"退出前に気圧を確認せよ","where":"worlds/knock-on-the-porthole/scenes/observation-corridor/elements/wall_left.js"},
  {"text":"←  AIRLOCK 2","translation":"←  エアロック 2","where":"worlds/knock-on-the-porthole/scenes/observation-corridor/elements/wall_right.js"},
  {"text":"OBSERVATION BAY · 4","translation":"観測室 · 4","where":"worlds/knock-on-the-porthole/scenes/observation-corridor/elements/wall_right.js"},
  {"text":"O₂ · EMERG. MASKS","translation":"O₂ · 非常用マスク","where":"worlds/knock-on-the-porthole/scenes/observation-corridor/elements/wall_right.js"},
  {"text":"Corridor by the Observation Bay","translation":"観測室そばの通路","where":"worlds/knock-on-the-porthole/scenes/observation-corridor/scene.json title"},
  {"text":"The Ladoga, deck 2. Emergency lighting, frost on the gratings, the airlock jammed.","translation":"〈ラドガ〉第2デッキ。非常灯、格子に霜、エアロックは固着している。","where":"worlds/knock-on-the-porthole/scenes/observation-corridor/scene.json caption"},
  {"text":"The doors of airlock 2 have opened all the way. Cold drifts out of the chamber, vapour creeps across the floor.","translation":"二番エアロックの扉が完全に開いた。室内から冷気が流れ出し、床を霧が這う。","where":"worlds/knock-on-the-porthole/scenes/observation-corridor/script.js"},
  {"text":"The doors of airlock 2 have parted a hand's width and stuck.","translation":"二番エアロックの扉が手のひらほど開いて止まった。","where":"worlds/knock-on-the-porthole/scenes/observation-corridor/script.js"},
  {"text":"Airlock 2 has closed and locked.","translation":"二番エアロックが閉じ、ロックされた。","where":"worlds/knock-on-the-porthole/scenes/observation-corridor/script.js"},
  {"text":"Vera has reached the airlock and taken hold of the manual drive's handle.","translation":"ヴェーラはエアロックにたどり着き、手動駆動のハンドルを握った。","where":"worlds/knock-on-the-porthole/scenes/observation-corridor/script.js"},
  {"text":"Vera has stopped at a porthole; beyond the glass, the red disc of the dwarf.","translation":"ヴェーラは舷窓のそばで立ち止まった。ガラスの向こうに、赤色矮星の赤い円盤。","where":"worlds/knock-on-the-porthole/scenes/observation-corridor/script.js"},
  {"text":"Vera has gone back to the observation bay hatch.","translation":"ヴェーラは観測室のハッチへ戻った。","where":"worlds/knock-on-the-porthole/scenes/observation-corridor/script.js"},
  {"text":"Vera has disappeared into the airlock.","translation":"ヴェーラはエアロックの中へ消えた。","where":"worlds/knock-on-the-porthole/scenes/observation-corridor/script.js"},
  {"text":"A trail of frost footprints from the airlock has reached the observation bay hatch.","translation":"エアロックから続く霜の足跡が、観測室のハッチまで届いた。","where":"worlds/knock-on-the-porthole/scenes/observation-corridor/script.js"},
  {"text":"Ten percent of the oxygen is left in the corridor.","translation":"通路の酸素は残り十パーセント。","where":"worlds/knock-on-the-porthole/scenes/observation-corridor/script.js"},
  {"text":"The speaker by the airlock has come alive: hiss on the channel of suit 2, as if someone is holding down the talk button.","translation":"エアロックのそばのスピーカーが生き返った。二番宇宙服のチャンネルにノイズ――誰かが送信ボタンを押したままでいるように。","where":"worlds/knock-on-the-porthole/scenes/observation-corridor/script.js"}
]}
